+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackopsrepl/hermes-solverforge-planner/c2ae4f2ad893501aa644c5f70b8fb6df65d0495d/docs/screenshots/tasks-tab.png
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackopsrepl/hermes-solverforge-planner/c2ae4f2ad893501aa644c5f70b8fb6df65d0495d/docs/screenshots/apply-confirm.png
